# ACCEPTANCE: cu-010

AC-1 Main calls the gate before entering the poll loop.
AC-2 A ready=false report logs every failing dependency, including `opencode-cli` when the binary is absent, and exits non-zero.
AC-3 The container is closed before the non-zero exit.
AC-4 ARCH.DI - all three adapters are constructed in AppContainer and injected into the gate.
AC-5 ARCH.STANDALONE - `grep -rn 'pipelines/ingestion' pipelines/enrichment/` prints nothing.
AC-6 `sbt compile` and `sbt test` exit 0 from `pipelines/enrichment`.
AC-7 With PATH lacking opencode, `sbt run` exits non-zero naming opencode-cli instead of looping.
